# Vercel CLI deploys of the songnest project upload the whole repo; the
# songnest project only builds crates/accounts (Root Directory). Exclude
# the heavy trees its Rust builder never touches so uploads stay small.
# NOTE: crates/** must stay (cargo workspace resolution needs every member
# manifest), as must the root Cargo.toml / Cargo.lock — and site/** must
# stay too, because the separate site project deploys this same repo.
web/
music/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.log
cookies*.txt
